{'symbol': 'JPM', 'date': '2023-01-05 06:00:00', 'title': 'JPMORGAN CHASE SURVEY: MOST BUSINESSES EXPECT RECESSION IN 2023', 'text': "NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE MAJORITY OF SMALL AND MIDSIZE U.S. BUSINESS LEADERS ANTICIPATE A RECESSION IN 2023, ACCORDING TO JPMORGAN CHASE'S 2023 ANNUAL BUSINESS LEADERS OUTLOOK SURVEY RELEASED TODAY. IN TOTAL, 65% OF MIDSIZE BUSINESSES AND 61% OF SMALL BUSINESSES EXPECT A RECESSION IN THE YEAR AHEAD."}